//! Gavel's test suite. Run it with `fe test`.
//!
//! - `harness`: `GavelHarness`, which hosts the production `Auction` with a
//!   clock the tests can move. It also has `Bidder` proxies that hold their
//!   own ETH and tokens, and helpers.
//! - `book_tests`: the clearing book's rules, one case at a time.
//! - `lifecycle_tests`: complete auctions from funding to the last payout.
//! - `guard_tests`: every phase check and validation error.
//! - `security_tests`: reentrancy, failing receivers and accounting.
//! - `differential_tests`: random auctions checked against a sort-based
//!   reference implementation.
//! - `gavel_tests`: the production `Gavel` contract and its block clock.
//! - `gas_tests`: gas measurements, reported as events
//!   (`fe test --show-logs --filter gas`).
